+From ec52f6ab0f53bd2a4b11d0818256d431b414e833 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Lukas Stockner <lukas@lukasstockner.de>
+Date: Sat, 14 Mar 2026 03:32:49 +0100
+Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Support a separate UBI partition for rootfs_data
+
+---
+ package/base-files/files/lib/upgrade/nand.sh  | 43 ++++++++++---------
+ .../base-files/lib/upgrade/platform.sh        |  1 +
+ .../base-files/lib/upgrade/platform.sh        |  1 +
+ .../base-files/lib/upgrade/platform.sh        |  3 ++
