+From 2068dbbcb0bd1f9f50065a1871e3ad2ca6eaa413 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Lukas Stockner <lukas@lukasstockner.de>
+Date: Sat, 14 Mar 2026 03:55:40 +0100
+Subject: [PATCH 2/2] ipq806x: add support for Aruba AP-325
+
+---
+ package/boot/uboot-envtools/files/ipq806x     |   9 +-
+ scripts/aruba-header.py                       | 223 ++++++++++
+ .../ipq806x/base-files/etc/board.d/02_network |   9 +-
